WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.528 --> 00:00:03.749
Bobby couldn't stop grinning.

2
00:00:03.909 --> 00:00:06.071
It was his birthday.

3
00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:14.976
Today at one o'clock he would be ten years old.

4
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.260
"Happy Birthday!"

5
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.241
the other campers called from the blacktop.

6
00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:37.743
"Thanks," Bobby said.

7
00:00:37.763 --> 00:00:39.884
"Where's the party?

8
00:00:40.844 --> 00:00:42.805
Who's hiding the presents and cake?"

9
00:00:43.786 --> 00:00:44.926
Mr. Dunn laughed.

10
00:00:44.946 --> 00:00:47.727
"Party? Presents?

11
00:00:48.728 --> 00:00:51.309
This is camp, not a party center."

12
00:00:51.329 --> 00:00:55.130
"Oh." Bobby's grin disappeared.

13
00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.371
"I was just kidding."

14
00:00:58.192 --> 00:00:59.052
He looked away.

15
00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:01.814
"Sort of," he thought.

16
00:01:05.156 --> 00:01:07.839
All morning the kids played kickball on the blacktop.

17
00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:12.743
When they went back inside, Bobby was still thinking about his birthday.

18
00:01:17.547 --> 00:01:21.109
For Ethan's birthday they had made special cupcakes with Miss Shelly.

19
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.592
But they weren't doing anything for Bobby's birthday!

20
00:01:26.034 --> 00:01:27.535
At twelve thirty Mr.

21
00:01:27.575 --> 00:01:28.796
Dunn made an announcement.

22
00:01:29.908 --> 00:01:31.849
"We're going out to the soccer field.

23
00:01:32.889 --> 00:01:41.253
Please line "That's weird," Bobby thought, following Mr.

24
00:01:41.293 --> 00:01:42.133
Dunn outside.

25
00:01:42.153 --> 00:01:45.995
"Mr. Dunn isn't carrying a soccer ball."

26
00:01:47.035 --> 00:01:49.016
None of the other kids seemed to notice.

27
00:01:54.178 --> 00:01:58.080
But when Bobby looked at the soccer field, he was even more confused.

28
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:01.357
There were four tables on the field.

29
00:02:02.317 --> 00:02:04.118
A black box sat on each one.

30
00:02:04.138 --> 00:02:07.099
"Birthday boy," Mr.

31
00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:07.860
Dunn called.

32
00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:12.301
"Inside each box is a present from one of your friends.

33
00:02:13.502 --> 00:02:17.343
You must use your senses to figure out what each one is.

34
00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.225
But you'll be blindfolded."

35
00:02:20.245 --> 00:02:25.387
"If you can figure out what is inside each box," Mr.

36
00:02:25.427 --> 00:02:28.048
Dunn continued, "the presents are yours.

37
00:02:29.228 --> 00:02:30.089
Think you can do it?"

38
00:02:30.989 --> 00:02:31.870
Bobby grinned.

39
00:02:32.691 --> 00:02:33.491
He was wrong.

40
00:02:34.452 --> 00:02:37.774
His friends had planned something special for his birthday!

41
00:02:37.794 --> 00:02:40.256
"Of course I can!"

42
00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:41.116
he said.

43
00:02:44.879 --> 00:02:45.940
the blindfold, Mr.

44
00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.301
Dunn," said Nina.

45
00:02:50.043 --> 00:02:53.605
She passed him a handkerchief, which he used to blindfold Bobby.

46
00:02:54.586 --> 00:02:55.126
Then Mr.

47
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:57.288
Dunn led Bobby up to the first box.

48
00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:04.921
"You have to use your sense of touch to guess what this present is," Mr.

49
00:03:04.961 --> 00:03:05.582
Dunn said.

50
00:03:06.902 --> 00:03:10.443
Bobby reached into the box and felt something hard and plastic.

51
00:03:12.263 --> 00:03:14.624
He pushed a lever and water shot out.

52
00:03:14.644 --> 00:03:18.725
"A spray soaker!"

53
00:03:19.085 --> 00:03:19.785
he shouted.

54
00:03:19.805 --> 00:03:21.806
"You guessed it!"

55
00:03:22.126 --> 00:03:22.746
Izzie said.

56
00:03:22.766 --> 00:03:25.307
The kids cheered.

57
00:03:25.327 --> 00:03:27.708
"Great job!"

58
00:03:28.088 --> 00:03:29.088
Mr. Dunn said.

59
00:03:30.204 --> 00:03:34.868
"Now, for box number two, you have to use your sense of smell."

60
00:03:36.969 --> 00:03:40.692
Ethan lifted the present out of the box and held it under Bobby's nose.

61
00:03:42.213 --> 00:03:43.174
Bobby sniffed.

62
00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:45.416
"I know this smell.

63
00:03:46.176 --> 00:03:47.297
A basketball!"

64
00:03:47.657 --> 00:03:48.298
he cried.

65
00:03:48.318 --> 00:03:50.379
"Right again!

66
00:03:51.881 --> 00:03:56.124
For box number three you can use only your sense of taste," Ethan said.

67
00:03:57.236 --> 00:04:01.118
Jason dipped a spoon into box number three and handed it to Bobby.

68
00:04:05.841 --> 00:04:07.602
cream!" cried Bobby.

69
00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:12.064
"Yum. It tastes like birthday cake!"

70
00:04:13.345 --> 00:04:14.785
Everyone cheered again.

71
00:04:15.766 --> 00:04:20.929
"For the last box, you have to use your sense of hearing," said Mr.

72
00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:25.531
Dunn. "How can I hear a present?"

73
00:04:25.951 --> 00:04:26.612
asked Bobby.

74
00:04:27.644 --> 00:04:29.466
Nina opened box number four.

75
00:04:29.486 --> 00:04:34.529
"I'm going to shake the present a little and then drop it on the table.

76
00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.851
Okay?" Nina said.

77
00:04:37.792 --> 00:04:38.653
Bobby nodded.

78
00:04:39.473 --> 00:04:41.074
Everyone got very quiet.

79
00:04:45.598 --> 00:04:50.081
What Bobby heard sounded like k-sh, k-sh, k-plonk.

80
00:04:50.101 --> 00:04:53.324
"I'd know that sound anywhere.

81
00:04:54.376 --> 00:04:57.558
It's a box of sour lemon balls—my favorite!"

82
00:04:57.898 --> 00:04:58.739
Bobby cried.

83
00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.182
He removed his blindfold and smiled at his friends.

84
00:05:05.443 --> 00:05:06.404
It was one o'clock.

85
00:05:07.665 --> 00:05:09.866
"Happy Birthday, Bobby!"

86
00:05:10.327 --> 00:05:11.307
shouted everyone.
